    "CLI 停下来等我回答" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "CLI stops to wait for my answer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CLI 停下来问你、或者在你没看的时候跑完一轮，都会出现在这里。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When a CLI stops to ask you something, or finishes a turn while you’re not looking, it shows up here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CLI 在 tmux 里还在跑时怎么处理。关标签的对话框里勾「不再询问」也会改这里。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "What to do when the CLI is still running in tmux. Checking “Don’t ask again” in the close-tab dialog also changes this."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CLI 正在 tmux 里运行。让它继续跑的话，关掉标签、退出 Switchboard 都不影响；之后点这个会话就会重新接上。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The CLI is running in tmux. If you keep it running, closing the tab or quitting Switchboard won’t stop it; click the session later to reattach."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CLI 跑完一轮" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "CLI finishes a turn"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CLI 跑完一轮、停下来等你时提醒" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Notify when a CLI finishes a turn and is waiting for you"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CLI 还在主机的 tmux 里跑 · 第 %lld 次 · %lld 秒后再试，Mac 唤醒或回到 app 时也会马上试" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The CLI is still running in tmux on the host · Attempt %lld · Retrying in %lld s, or right away when your Mac wakes or you return to the app"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code 2.1.248 · Codex 0.160.0 可以启动" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Claude Code 2.1.248 · Codex 0.160.0 can launch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codex 和 OpenCode 的会话会永久删除；这台 Mac 上 Claude Code 和 omp 的移到废纸篓。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Codex and OpenCode sessions are deleted permanently; Claude Code and omp sessions on this Mac are moved to the Trash."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect…（交互登录）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connect… (Interactive Sign-In)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ghostty 用 GPU 渲染，大量输出时更流畅。只对之后新开的标签生效，开着的标签不变。字体选「系统等宽」时用 Ghostty 自带的字体。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ghostty renders on the GPU and stays smooth with heavy output. It applies to tabs you open from now on; open tabs keep their engine. With System Monospaced selected, Ghostty uses its built-in font."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSH 主机" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SSH Hosts"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSH 主机上没有废纸篓，主机上的会话会永久删除。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SSH hosts have no Trash, so sessions on the host are deleted permanently."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSH 主机连不上…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SSH Host Won’t Connect…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SwiftTerm 是默认引擎。换成 Ghostty 只对之后新开的标签生效。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SwiftTerm is the default engine. Switching to Ghostty applies to tabs you open from now on."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switchboard 上次意外退出了" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Switchboard quit unexpectedly last time"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switchboard 不保存你在这里输入的任何内容。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Switchboard doesn’t save anything you type here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switchboard 主机体检：%@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Switchboard Host Check: %@"
