    "Switchboard 使用说明" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Switchboard User Guide"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switchboard 在主机上用 python3 给 OpenCode 的库做一份只含会话的快照再拷过来（不拷账号和凭据）。装上 python3 就行。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
