        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Switchboard launches CLIs without reading interactive startup scripts ($SHELL -lc), so it isn’t affected. But PATH entries set after the interactive check in ~/.bashrc (such as nvm) won’t be found. Change that line so it only runs when you log in yourself."
