            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Check the projects to show in the sidebar. For a folder with no sessions yet, enter its path."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "升级 tmux 后旧服务器还在跑，它的会话能继续跑但打不开，新标签会马上报错退出。用启动它的那个 tmux 重新接上，或结束这些会话后重开。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After a tmux upgrade, the old server is still running. Its sessions keep running but can't be opened, and new tabs exit with an error right away. Reattach with the tmux that started it, or end those sessions and start again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "升级 tmux 后旧服务器还在跑：它的会话还在，但打不开，新标签会马上报错。用启动它的那个 tmux 接上，或者结束这些会话后重开。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The old tmux server is still running after an upgrade. Its sessions are still there but can't be opened, and new tabs fail right away. Attach with the tmux that started it, or end those sessions and start again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
