    },
    "只读，不改主机上的任何东西。慢的那一步会显示耗时。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Read-only. Nothing on the host is changed. Slow steps show how long they took."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可以把这次崩溃报告给开发者。会打开 GitHub 的问题表单，版本和崩溃摘要已经填好，不含你的文件路径；你可以补一句当时在做什么。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can report this crash to the developer. This opens a GitHub issue form with the versions and a crash summary filled in, without your file paths. Add a line about what you were doing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可选。允许终端里的 CLI 控制其他 app（点菜单、按键）。会给所有 CLI，按需开启" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Optional. Lets CLIs in the terminal control other apps (click menus, press keys). Applies to every CLI, so turn it on only if needed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可选。终端里的 CLI 打开「文稿」等受保护文件夹时不再逐个弹窗" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Optional. Stops the prompts each time a CLI in the terminal opens a protected folder such as “Documents.”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可选。退出码为 0 表示还有效，比如 klist -s；每 5 分钟跑一次。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Optional. Exit code 0 means still valid, e.g. klist -s. Runs every 5 minutes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
