    "这台 Mac 没见过这台主机的密钥。只有和主机管理员给你的指纹完全一致时才信任；不一致就取消，可能有人在中间冒充它。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This Mac hasn’t seen this host’s key before. Trust it only if it exactly matches the fingerprint from the host’s administrator. If it doesn’t match, cancel: someone may be impersonating the host."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这台 Mac 没见过这台主机的密钥。只有和主机管理员给你的指纹（上面）完全一致时才信任；不一致就取消。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
